{"unit_id":"liguobao__ds-harness-remote#card-zh","repo":"liguobao/ds-harness-remote","commit":"24160bd52e070f55e4e5a949d111644ca4a9a763","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"ds-harness-remote 是面向 DSH 浏览器和桌面 Host 的远程访问插件，可让 Web 与 Android 等客户端连接本机工作区。它将插件注入 DSH 连接、侧边栏和设置界面，并通过对等连接支持 Harness 会话、文件浏览与传输、终端及可选的 Codex/ACP 工作区。内置 Remote Tools 可发现主机和工作区、读写 Harness 会话并等待执行状态。适合需要离开电脑后继续处理本地项目的用户；需要 Remote 账户和可用的 Remote Server。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/plugin/src/index.ts:101-152","packages/plugin/src/client.ts:1-80","packages/plugin/src/remote-tools.ts:31-82","packages/plugin/src/config.ts:6-20"]}
